# Generated/rebuilt data — the server reassembles sofia.db from the
# .gz.*.part chunks under data/ at first startup (server/src/db.js), and
# the .pmtiles files are pipeline output. ~120MB total, none of it needs to
# be versioned here — regenerate via the pipeline instead.
data/

# Node dependencies — reinstalled via `npm install` from package-lock.json.
node_modules/

# SQLite runtime files, in case data/ is ever un-ignored for some reason.
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Scratch folder of files delivered into Claude conversations over time —
# not part of the running app; canonical copies live in server/ and web/.
Claude outputs/

# OS/editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Meilisearch (added for the 2026-09-14 search migration) — the binary is
# ~50MB and its db-path is regenerated by a full reindex on every server
# start (see server/src/index.js), so neither belongs in git.
meilisearch/

# Local secret (Meilisearch master key) — see server/meili-env.bat's own
# top comment. Never commit this file.
server/meili-env.bat

# Runtime logs (2026-09-14) — restart-server.bat/start-meilisearch.bat pipe
# the server's and Meilisearch's full console output here for diagnosing
# issues without watching a flickering console window (see
# implementation-log.md, "Шестая волна"). They're appended to on every
# restart, so they're always "dirty" from git's point of view and were
# never meant to be versioned — pure local diagnostic output, not source.
server.log
meilisearch.log
setup-meilisearch.log

# Routing prototype (2026-09-16/17) — downloaded/built third-party routing
# engines and their generated data: a full JDK runtime (one file alone,
# lib/modules, is ~140MB), Valhalla's built tiles, Motis/OTP builds, a
# downloaded GTFS feed archive, and debug inspection dumps (some files
# hundreds of thousands of lines). Same reasoning as data/ and meilisearch/
# above — none of it is source, all of it is downloaded or rebuilt by
# routing-proto/routing-proto.ps1 and the setup/start .bat scripts, which
# ARE source and stay tracked. A first commit accidentally swept ~2GB of
# this in via `git add -A` before it was ever pushed — see
# implementation-log.md for the cleanup.
routing-proto/jdk/
routing-proto/valhalla/
routing-proto/motis/
routing-proto/otp/
routing-proto/gtfs_inspect/
routing-proto/gtfs_static.zip
routing-proto/logs/

# Raw pipeline input (OSM extracts, ~280MB combined) — same reasoning as
# data/: re-download/regenerate rather than version.
raw/
/*.pbf

# Downloaded third-party tool, not source.
planetiler.jar

# Stray files from a botched command (2026-09-16/17), never real content —
# safe to ignore.
/.bat
/real
/the

# More one-off diagnostic scratch (same reasoning as server.log et al.).
server-diag.log
setup-valhalla.log
test-inner.log
test-inner2.log
